    "description": "Inn (inn stage of the visitors' camp), level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 509 blocks vs 315 (first build 419 vs 255). Two-storey inn: stone common room (hearth, two tables, a bar of kegs), six beds in the timber upper storey up a staircase; L2 the stable lean-to, a projecting sign, lanterns and shutters; L3 a porch over the door, a Welcome signpost, flower boxes, banner and chimney smoke. Not yet builder-tested: cauldron, oak_hanging_sign. Decoration step adds: sign_text, water.",
